WEBVTT

00:00:00.360 --> 00:00:01.310
Hey!

00:00:01.310 --> 00:00:02.770
Let me see it!

00:00:02.770 --> 00:00:04.110
Wait-

00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:09.980
Jesus Christ...

00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:11.740
Why the heck do you have this?

00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:18.820
You didn't have to hide it...

00:00:18.820 --> 00:00:20.790
If you really wanted to...

00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:27.920
Well, I have to apologize!

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:31.290
What I actually wanted was
Hideyoshi's picture, not your-

00:00:31.290 --> 00:00:33.420
Can't breathe!

00:00:33.580 --> 00:00:35.070
This is the last straw!

00:00:35.070 --> 00:00:36.130
Feel my wrath!

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:38.470
This is your payback for always being a bitch to me!

00:00:38.470 --> 00:00:39.690
Teacher!

00:00:39.690 --> 00:00:41.570
I request a mock-ESB!

00:00:41.570 --> 00:00:42.970
Permission to summon, please!

00:00:43.470 --> 00:00:44.520
All right.

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:45.950
Approved!

00:00:47.020 --> 00:00:48.440
Summoning Being...

00:00:48.440 --> 00:00:49.520
Summon!

00:00:52.440 --> 00:00:54.420
Summoning Being...

00:00:54.420 --> 00:00:55.680
Summon!

00:00:59.690 --> 00:01:00.470
Huh?

00:01:00.470 --> 00:01:03.480
Summon!

00:01:03.480 --> 00:01:06.290
Summon! Summon! Summon!

00:01:06.290 --> 00:01:07.920
That's odd...

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:09.100
What's going on?

00:01:09.480 --> 00:01:12.860
Summon! Summon! Summon!

00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:23.640
Summon! Summon!!!!!!!!!

00:01:23.890 --> 00:01:25.460
Approval denied!

00:01:30.440 --> 00:01:31.390
What the...

00:01:31.390 --> 00:01:32.860
I can't control the ESB field!

00:01:47.650 --> 00:01:52.860
Something that grows when its alone, What is it?

00:01:52.860 --> 00:01:54.140
One more chance, One more chance!

00:01:54.140 --> 00:01:55.520
Never, Never give up!

00:01:55.520 --> 00:01:56.820
One more chance, One more chance!

00:01:56.820 --> 00:01:58.120
Never give up!

00:02:08.610 --> 00:02:11.250
Meeting with someone else is easy

00:02:11.250 --> 00:02:14.020
I decided what to say before they even asked

00:02:14.020 --> 00:02:16.630
My heart beats fast thinking if I passed or not

00:02:16.630 --> 00:02:18.810
I can't panic in this fight for love

00:02:19.240 --> 00:02:21.880
Study! Study! Study! Keeps me up all night

00:02:21.880 --> 00:02:24.510
I've got a dreaming genius inside me

00:02:24.510 --> 00:02:27.090
I'd be great if everyone's wishes came true

00:02:27.090 --> 00:02:29.260
I won't care about other people's lives

00:02:29.610 --> 00:02:32.220
Perfect-area complete!

00:02:32.220 --> 00:02:34.850
I'll definitely be waiting for you!

00:02:34.850 --> 00:02:41.250
I can hear your voice from the Perfect-area!

00:02:41.250 --> 00:02:42.560
Ah! Ear! Ear!

00:02:42.560 --> 00:02:45.830
Why? Why can't stop when I pass you

00:02:45.830 --> 00:02:48.440
if I'm your counselor

00:02:48.440 --> 00:02:51.030
"Are we friends?" Yes, we're friends."

00:02:51.030 --> 00:02:53.030
But, I failed the test with a 0

00:02:53.030 --> 00:02:56.340
No! I'll take it again! and again!

00:02:56.340 --> 00:02:58.480
I'm serious. One more chance, please

00:02:58.480 --> 00:03:02.950
There's something better for is in the future

00:03:03.680 --> 00:03:09.040
Better than my life right now.

00:03:12.540 --> 00:03:15.880
Disaster always strikes unannounced.

00:03:22.010 --> 00:03:22.760
Who is it?

00:03:25.450 --> 00:03:26.790
The password?

00:03:26.790 --> 00:03:28.660
I lust.

00:03:28.660 --> 00:03:29.140
Good.

00:03:29.390 --> 00:03:30.100
Do you have it?

00:03:30.100 --> 00:03:32.020
Where's the cash?

00:03:41.240 --> 00:03:45.200
Hell yeah, Hideyoshi in a waitress outfit!

00:03:45.750 --> 00:03:48.150
Makes me glad to be alive...

00:03:48.600 --> 00:03:49.870
That's not all.

00:03:49.870 --> 00:03:51.770
This is a picture of him changing.

00:03:51.770 --> 00:03:53.080
It'll cost you double, though.

00:03:54.620 --> 00:03:56.600
Can't you cut me a deal?

00:03:56.600 --> 00:03:59.050
I'm already living off salt water this week.

00:03:59.330 --> 00:04:01.170
Buy one, get one free.

00:04:02.230 --> 00:04:04.050
God...

00:04:17.110 --> 00:04:17.860
Damn.

00:04:17.860 --> 00:04:20.290
This is so much work...

00:04:21.070 --> 00:04:22.520
Another layer of security?

00:04:22.520 --> 00:04:24.270
The pass is...

00:04:24.740 --> 00:04:25.410
Shit!

00:04:34.070 --> 00:04:35.060
Fuck...

00:04:35.060 --> 00:04:36.270
I almost pissed my pants.

00:04:47.410 --> 00:04:48.970
Looks like we have a problem here.

00:04:48.970 --> 00:04:50.100
Excuse me.

00:04:50.450 --> 00:04:51.530
Director.

00:04:51.530 --> 00:04:53.480
There seems to be a problem with the summoning system.

00:04:53.670 --> 00:04:54.320
Yeah.

00:04:54.790 --> 00:04:56.400
I can see that.

00:04:59.310 --> 00:05:00.950
Even here?

00:05:00.950 --> 00:05:02.610
What's going on?

00:05:02.610 --> 00:05:04.450
Do you ever shut up?

00:05:05.480 --> 00:05:07.200
Get away.

00:05:09.280 --> 00:05:10.640
Ow! Holy shit!

00:05:10.640 --> 00:05:11.830
Stop it!

00:05:11.830 --> 00:05:12.920
Yoshii.

00:05:12.920 --> 00:05:15.000
What the hell did you do this time?

00:05:15.230 --> 00:05:17.920
Why am I always the number one suspect?

00:05:17.920 --> 00:05:20.310
What did you do, Akihisa?

00:05:20.310 --> 00:05:22.300
You'd better fess up.

00:05:22.300 --> 00:05:23.760
We won't get mad.

00:05:23.760 --> 00:05:25.010
You guys too?

00:05:25.260 --> 00:05:28.680
Well, your Being's the only one that's acting up.

00:05:31.250 --> 00:05:31.990
Huh?

00:05:31.990 --> 00:05:33.110
How?

00:05:33.110 --> 00:05:35.730
Maybe the system is unstable...

00:05:35.730 --> 00:05:37.960
I'll try to summon mine.

00:05:38.690 --> 00:05:39.900
Summon!

00:05:44.090 --> 00:05:46.010
A grown-up version, huh?

00:05:46.570 --> 00:05:48.570
Please don't look at it!

00:05:49.780 --> 00:05:50.660
Eye

00:05:51.260 --> 00:05:53.580
Yuuji, no looking.

00:05:56.750 --> 00:06:00.080
I wonder if that's what Himeji will look like in a few years...

00:06:01.480 --> 00:06:03.860
She's so... well-developed.

00:06:04.490 --> 00:06:05.760
Hey, I'm going to be too...

00:06:05.760 --> 00:06:07.170
Summon!

00:06:08.060 --> 00:06:08.940
Look at that.

00:06:08.940 --> 00:06:11.600
She's just like her master, completely undev-

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:13.430
Holy shit, a Frankensteiner!

00:06:15.080 --> 00:06:16.100
Wait a minute!

00:06:17.130 --> 00:06:17.230
Maybe I can get a nude shot if I do this.

00:06:17.230 --> 00:06:19.490
No, please don't!
Maybe I can get a nude shot if I do this.

00:06:19.490 --> 00:06:19.700
Maybe I can get a nude shot if I do this.

00:06:19.700 --> 00:06:20.810
You're brilliant, Voyeur!

00:06:20.810 --> 00:06:23.360
Please don't!

00:06:24.520 --> 00:06:28.110
Stop it!!!

00:06:31.490 --> 00:06:33.200
Skeletal frame.

00:06:33.390 --> 00:06:35.970
Well, it sounded like a good idea.

00:06:35.970 --> 00:06:37.830
Maybe if I back up some more...

00:06:38.020 --> 00:06:40.080
This is pretty cool.

00:06:40.080 --> 00:06:41.830
I think I'll summon mine as well.

00:06:42.100 --> 00:06:43.250
Summon!

00:06:43.790 --> 00:06:45.070
Don't do that...

00:06:45.070 --> 00:06:47.120
Don't, Mr. Wolf!

00:06:47.120 --> 00:06:47.510
A babe!

00:06:47.510 --> 00:06:48.490
Please stop.
A babe!

00:06:48.490 --> 00:06:49.280
I knew it, Hideyoshi!
Please stop.

00:06:49.280 --> 00:06:51.020
I knew it, Hideyoshi!

00:06:51.020 --> 00:06:53.680
I wasn't mistaken about you!

00:06:53.680 --> 00:06:55.380
This is obviously a mistake!

00:06:55.380 --> 00:06:57.180
There's an error in the system!

00:06:57.470 --> 00:06:58.130
Then...

00:06:58.130 --> 00:06:59.850
I guess I'll try too.

00:07:00.210 --> 00:07:01.230
Summon!

00:07:05.860 --> 00:07:06.890
Fabulous...

00:07:07.400 --> 00:07:08.480
I'll do it too...

00:07:08.880 --> 00:07:09.990
Summon!

00:07:16.680 --> 00:07:17.870
They look so cute together.

00:07:17.870 --> 00:07:20.210
What about you, Voyeur?

00:07:20.570 --> 00:07:21.420
Summon.

00:07:25.290 --> 00:07:25.420
<b>Yuji</b>

00:07:25.420 --> 00:07:27.210
<b>You're so stubborn...</b>

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:27.590
<b>Don't you...</b>

00:07:27.590 --> 00:07:27.760
Hang-

00:07:27.760 --> 00:07:28.240
<b>Yuji</b>

00:07:28.240 --> 00:07:28.420
<b>Don't you...</b>

00:07:28.420 --> 00:07:29.010
<b>want me?</b>

00:07:29.010 --> 00:07:29.760
<b>Yuji</b>

00:07:29.760 --> 00:07:30.010
<b>want me?</b>

00:07:30.010 --> 00:07:30.130
<b>Yuji</b>

00:07:30.340 --> 00:07:30.530
<b>Don't think so
highly of yourself...</b>

00:07:30.530 --> 00:07:31.590
<b>Kouta
Don't think so
highly of yourself...</b>

00:07:31.590 --> 00:07:32.260
<b>You said you wouldn't do a thing to me.</b>

00:07:32.260 --> 00:07:32.700
<b>Kouta
You said you wouldn't do a thing to me.</b>

00:07:32.700 --> 00:07:33.800
I love you.

00:07:33.800 --> 00:07:35.220
<b>Kouta</b>

00:07:35.220 --> 00:07:36.720
<b>You liar.</b>

00:07:42.060 --> 00:07:43.170
Wait a minute!

00:07:43.170 --> 00:07:44.970
No! It's malfunctioning...!

00:07:44.970 --> 00:07:47.230
Don't do it!

00:07:48.220 --> 00:07:49.920
Traitor.

00:07:49.920 --> 00:07:53.820
What does yours look like, Yoshii?

00:07:53.820 --> 00:07:55.260
Come on, show us!

00:07:55.260 --> 00:07:56.080
All right, I'll give it a shot.

00:07:56.380 --> 00:07:57.490
Summon!

00:08:04.760 --> 00:08:06.420
This is dumb...

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:09.410
Why is mine the odd one out?

00:08:15.110 --> 00:08:16.930
Oh, they're back to normal.

00:08:22.310 --> 00:08:23.530
What's going on?

00:08:23.530 --> 00:08:25.060
They're going out of control!

00:08:26.550 --> 00:08:28.070
Where are they going?

00:08:28.070 --> 00:08:29.570
What's going on?

00:08:31.110 --> 00:08:34.290
The teacher's Beings were being held near the core,

00:08:34.290 --> 00:08:37.240
so they've completely frozen. They can't be summoned.

00:08:37.710 --> 00:08:40.370
Meanwhile, the students' Beings are out of control.

00:08:41.840 --> 00:08:42.450
I can't access the server room's security system.

00:08:42.450 --> 00:08:46.340
Doors
Security
Core
Power
UPS
Server Room

00:08:46.340 --> 00:08:50.520
This means that we can't open the
doors. There's no way to fix the core.

00:08:50.520 --> 00:08:53.190
Couldn't we turn off the power to the system?

00:08:53.190 --> 00:08:57.620
It'll keep running for at least a month with the UPS.

00:08:57.620 --> 00:08:58.900
That would mean...

00:08:58.900 --> 00:08:59.430
Server Room
UPS
Power
Core
Security
Doors

00:08:59.430 --> 00:09:02.350
that we'd have to bruteforce our way in.

00:09:02.350 --> 00:09:06.150
We're holding a presentation about the security system tomorrow.

00:09:06.150 --> 00:09:09.820
We can't do that if there's a hole in the wall.

00:09:09.820 --> 00:09:11.530
Then what should we do?

00:09:13.260 --> 00:09:14.370
Oh, I know.

00:09:14.950 --> 00:09:17.610
Why don't we put the idiot to work for a bit?

00:09:17.820 --> 00:09:18.120
Counter-Measure Headquarters
Berserk
Exam Summoning System

00:09:18.120 --> 00:09:19.320
I'm supposed to fix what, now?

00:09:19.560 --> 00:09:24.150
The Beings of Punishment Inspectors run under a different system,

00:09:24.150 --> 00:09:27.540
so they're not affected by the
malfunction like the other students'.

00:09:27.730 --> 00:09:28.810
I see.

00:09:28.810 --> 00:09:32.510
So that's why Akihisa's Being was acting differently from ours.

00:09:32.510 --> 00:09:34.920
But I couldn't summon it properly.

00:09:35.220 --> 00:09:38.390
That's because you tried to summon it in a corrupted Instructor Field.

00:09:38.390 --> 00:09:41.430
But you have your own field, right?

00:09:41.430 --> 00:09:42.380
Oh yeah!

00:09:42.380 --> 00:09:43.890
I have this iron bracelet.

00:09:43.890 --> 00:09:47.920
Go into the server room with your Being and connect the cable.

00:09:47.920 --> 00:09:51.810
After that, I'll shut off the security system from the terminal and open the doors.

00:09:51.810 --> 00:09:56.970
Heh. This plan wouldn't work without a Being that can manipulate physical space.

00:09:56.970 --> 00:10:00.370
My Being can't go through walls, though...

00:10:00.370 --> 00:10:02.790
There's an AC vent that's used for system cooling.

00:10:03.270 --> 00:10:05.470
Your Being should be small enough to pass through.

00:10:05.470 --> 00:10:09.670
How is he supposed to control it without being able to see where it's going?

00:10:09.670 --> 00:10:10.400
Here.

00:10:10.790 --> 00:10:13.230
A video camera and a transmitter.

00:10:13.230 --> 00:10:17.160
If you give these to your Being, you'll be able to see the inside of the vent.

00:10:17.160 --> 00:10:19.110
You're so smart, Voyeur!

00:10:19.110 --> 00:10:21.220
I'm surprised you have those on you.

00:10:21.220 --> 00:10:22.600
What do you use them for?

00:10:23.660 --> 00:10:25.570
Don't treat him like that!

00:10:25.570 --> 00:10:26.820
He's actually a great guy!

00:10:26.820 --> 00:10:27.470
He's just a little, well, really perverse!

00:10:27.470 --> 00:10:29.700
I haven't even said anything...

00:10:29.700 --> 00:10:32.270
Well, Akihisa's his VIP customer.

00:10:32.550 --> 00:10:35.180
The iron bracelet can only create a short-range summoning field.

00:10:35.180 --> 00:10:37.840
You'll have to control your Being from right outside the server room.

00:10:37.840 --> 00:10:39.950
We'll direct you from here.

00:10:44.860 --> 00:10:46.320
So that's the entrance.

00:10:47.470 --> 00:10:48.450
Awaken!

00:10:50.080 --> 00:10:51.140
Summon!

00:10:52.960 --> 00:10:54.340
Go!

00:10:59.970 --> 00:11:02.910
The Being has entered the vent.

00:11:02.910 --> 00:11:04.310
Course clear.

00:11:04.310 --> 00:11:06.560
Keep going forward, Akihisa.

00:11:06.560 --> 00:11:07.290
Roger that!

00:11:07.920 --> 00:11:09.270
Are you certain about this?

00:11:09.270 --> 00:11:11.030
He's under special observation...

00:11:11.030 --> 00:11:12.550
In other words, he's a problem child.

00:11:12.550 --> 00:11:14.220
We don't have a choice.

00:11:14.220 --> 00:11:18.030
He's the only one who can use the iron bracelet.

00:11:18.340 --> 00:11:20.480
Turn right at 3 meters ahead.

00:11:20.480 --> 00:11:21.820
Turn left at the first cross road.

00:11:22.020 --> 00:11:24.010
This is a friggin' maze.

00:11:24.410 --> 00:11:26.380
Why is it so confusing?

00:11:26.380 --> 00:11:28.000
It's another brand of security.

00:11:30.870 --> 00:11:33.620
Shit, I'm feeling numb!

00:11:33.620 --> 00:11:34.880
I'm losing points!

00:11:34.880 --> 00:11:36.630
What the hell?

00:11:36.630 --> 00:11:38.550
There's a poison swamp.

00:11:38.550 --> 00:11:40.830
Why the hell would you do that!?

00:11:40.830 --> 00:11:42.620
It's another brand of security.

00:11:42.620 --> 00:11:44.410
We'll avoid the danger zones.

00:11:44.410 --> 00:11:45.890
Turn right at the next corner.

00:11:47.860 --> 00:11:49.100
I can see a light.

00:11:49.560 --> 00:11:50.940
You're almost there.

00:11:50.940 --> 00:11:52.390
Keep going straight.

00:11:52.390 --> 00:11:53.260
Huh?

00:11:53.260 --> 00:11:54.250
What are those?

00:11:57.470 --> 00:11:59.020
Summoned Beings?!

00:11:59.920 --> 00:12:01.740
Berserk Beings have appeared!

00:12:01.740 --> 00:12:03.170
Incoming attack!

00:12:15.050 --> 00:12:16.600
Make it stop, Yuuji!

00:12:16.600 --> 00:12:17.190
I can't.

00:12:17.190 --> 00:12:18.420
I can't control him!

00:12:18.420 --> 00:12:19.500
No...

00:12:19.500 --> 00:12:20.430
No!

00:12:20.430 --> 00:12:21.170
This can't be happening!

00:12:21.640 --> 00:12:23.100
Stop this, please!

00:12:23.100 --> 00:12:24.270
Stop it!

00:12:24.270 --> 00:12:28.910
Yuuji! Hideyoshi! Minori! Himeji! Dad!

00:12:28.910 --> 00:12:30.030
Stop!

00:12:30.030 --> 00:12:31.270
Make it stop!

00:12:58.990 --> 00:13:01.600
Those who were KIA must receive supplementary lessons.

00:13:01.600 --> 00:13:05.600
This can't be!

00:13:05.930 --> 00:13:08.880
Berserk and Maze and
Beings Instrumentality Project

00:13:14.620 --> 00:13:16.830
Are you okay, Yoshii?

00:13:17.650 --> 00:13:19.290
I've seen Hell.

00:13:19.290 --> 00:13:21.000
How was the lesson?

00:13:21.180 --> 00:13:22.760
We'll resume the mission.

00:13:22.760 --> 00:13:25.670
Please take the recovery exam and replenish your points.

00:13:25.830 --> 00:13:29.630
He'll have to get a really high
score to survive those attacks...

00:13:30.550 --> 00:13:32.250
Yoshii.

00:13:32.250 --> 00:13:36.480
Would you like me to help you study?

00:13:36.700 --> 00:13:37.940
Yoshii.

00:13:38.590 --> 00:13:44.400
Would you like me to help you study?

00:13:44.410 --> 00:13:47.420
A private lesson with you!?

00:13:47.420 --> 00:13:48.700
Really?

00:13:48.700 --> 00:13:52.700
You sure pick up stuff like <i>that</i> quickly, eh?

00:13:53.130 --> 00:13:56.370
It's useless unless it shows immediate results.

00:13:56.370 --> 00:13:58.740
Well, then I have a great idea.

00:14:04.010 --> 00:14:06.390
Points

00:14:06.930 --> 00:14:08.190
I see.

00:14:08.190 --> 00:14:12.090
He can get easy points with these easy problems.

00:14:12.090 --> 00:14:14.100
It's kinda cheating, though.

00:14:14.430 --> 00:14:15.270
Wow.

00:14:15.270 --> 00:14:18.220
Akihisa's power level is off the charts!

00:14:18.220 --> 00:14:20.150
You're doing great, Yoshii.

00:14:20.150 --> 00:14:21.680
Keep it up, Aki.

00:14:23.940 --> 00:14:26.610
What did you get wrong, Akihisa?

00:14:27.410 --> 00:14:30.470
The Taika Reform was in 645!

00:14:30.470 --> 00:14:33.320
How could you possibly forget that after what happened a little while ago!?

00:14:33.320 --> 00:14:36.200
That's why I got confused!

00:14:36.480 --> 00:14:39.630
Well, anyway, he's leveled up quite a bit, hasn't he?

00:14:39.630 --> 00:14:42.870
He should be able to deal with the enemy attacks now.

00:14:42.870 --> 00:14:44.710
Resume mission.

00:14:44.710 --> 00:14:45.880
All right.

00:14:47.050 --> 00:14:47.920
Summon!

00:14:51.470 --> 00:14:54.000
I am so gonna beat it this time.

00:14:54.000 --> 00:14:54.710
All right.

00:14:54.710 --> 00:14:56.390
Take a left at that crossroad.

00:14:56.390 --> 00:14:57.240
Roger that.

00:14:58.390 --> 00:15:00.400
The poison swamp.

00:15:00.810 --> 00:15:03.560
I guess it hurts no matter how high your level is.

00:15:03.560 --> 00:15:05.230
Look, I'm not a lab rat!

00:15:06.440 --> 00:15:08.580
Take a right when you reach the end.

00:15:08.580 --> 00:15:09.460
Okay.

00:15:10.450 --> 00:15:12.050
Be careful, Akihisa.

00:15:12.050 --> 00:15:13.490
If you touch it...

00:15:14.670 --> 00:15:15.820
Yoshii?

00:15:15.820 --> 00:15:16.740
Aki?

00:15:17.180 --> 00:15:18.910
I can't breathe!

00:15:18.910 --> 00:15:20.520
I told you to watch out!

00:15:20.520 --> 00:15:22.710
It's a bad habit of mine...

00:15:23.990 --> 00:15:24.940
That's...

00:15:37.510 --> 00:15:39.890
All right! I'm not gonna lose again!

00:15:46.860 --> 00:15:48.320
Victory is mine!

00:15:48.620 --> 00:15:50.340
Don't let your guard down!

00:15:50.340 --> 00:15:51.530
Tsuchiya's coming.

00:15:51.810 --> 00:15:52.970
Worry not!

00:15:52.970 --> 00:15:54.740
The subject is history!

00:15:55.980 --> 00:16:01.950
He's only good at health, so
there's no way he can beat me!

00:16:04.540 --> 00:16:06.390
Danger

00:16:07.990 --> 00:16:10.250
There stood a poison swamp.

00:16:10.450 --> 00:16:13.220
Those who were KIA must receive supplementary lessons!

00:16:14.360 --> 00:16:15.740
That isn't fair!

00:16:15.740 --> 00:16:18.130
The Beings lost on their own!

00:16:18.130 --> 00:16:19.770
Resistance is futile!

00:16:25.660 --> 00:16:26.810
I made it.

00:16:27.090 --> 00:16:29.330
There should be a disconnected cable.

00:16:29.330 --> 00:16:30.730
Connect it.

00:16:30.730 --> 00:16:31.570
Roger.

00:16:32.960 --> 00:16:33.990
There it is.

00:16:39.740 --> 00:16:40.700
Minami?

00:16:40.850 --> 00:16:41.790
Aki!

00:16:41.790 --> 00:16:43.150
Run!

00:16:43.150 --> 00:16:43.580
But...

00:16:43.770 --> 00:16:44.890
Now!

00:16:45.480 --> 00:16:46.580
If you don't...

00:16:46.940 --> 00:16:48.050
My...

00:16:52.710 --> 00:16:53.950
Himeji...

00:16:54.380 --> 00:16:57.300
Wooden Horse!

00:17:00.410 --> 00:17:01.380
Minami!

00:17:05.150 --> 00:17:11.980
Yoshii!

00:17:12.220 --> 00:17:13.400
Aki!

00:17:21.240 --> 00:17:25.830
God dammit!

00:17:32.460 --> 00:17:33.690
Something's approaching!

00:17:34.670 --> 00:17:37.050
Phase synchronization detected in the field!

00:17:37.050 --> 00:17:39.220
A Being is approaching!

00:17:39.220 --> 00:17:43.720
Sissy!

00:17:43.720 --> 00:17:44.640
Miharu?

00:17:44.640 --> 00:17:49.340
It might be just your Being, but I won't let anyone else have it either!

00:17:49.340 --> 00:17:52.150
I won't allow it to touch anyone's except mine!

00:17:52.480 --> 00:17:53.450
Now's my chance!

00:17:59.640 --> 00:18:01.430
Supplementary lessons!

00:18:01.430 --> 00:18:03.370
No!!

00:18:03.370 --> 00:18:04.330
Yay!

00:18:04.470 --> 00:18:06.400
I'm sorry, Himeji.

00:18:10.330 --> 00:18:11.440
I did it!

00:18:36.980 --> 00:18:38.890
Yoshii! You won't make it!

00:18:38.890 --> 00:18:40.080
Run!

00:18:40.080 --> 00:18:41.370
But...

00:18:41.370 --> 00:18:42.730
I've come this far.

00:18:43.200 --> 00:18:44.660
There's no turning back.

00:18:55.250 --> 00:18:56.250
Yoshii!

00:18:57.850 --> 00:18:58.720
I'm...

00:18:59.540 --> 00:19:00.840
so close...

00:19:00.840 --> 00:19:02.770
This isn't going to work.

00:19:02.770 --> 00:19:04.050
We should pull him back!

00:19:05.790 --> 00:19:09.220
I don't think teachers should be forcing students to do-

00:19:09.220 --> 00:19:10.080
Not yet!

00:19:11.080 --> 00:19:12.880
I'm still alive.

00:19:13.560 --> 00:19:16.160
You don't have enough points left!

00:19:16.160 --> 00:19:17.820
The difference in strength is too big!

00:19:17.820 --> 00:19:18.750
But...

00:19:19.210 --> 00:19:20.310
That doesn't mean...

00:19:23.360 --> 00:19:24.530
Strength?

00:19:24.530 --> 00:19:25.560
That's it!

00:19:25.560 --> 00:19:27.710
Difference in points doesn't always equal a difference in strength.

00:19:27.710 --> 00:19:30.580
Remember how my Being got stronger!

00:19:30.580 --> 00:19:33.030
Himeji, take the recovery exam!

00:19:33.480 --> 00:19:34.410
Please!

00:19:35.850 --> 00:19:37.540
I see what you mean.

00:19:39.100 --> 00:19:40.420
Ms. Takahashi!

00:19:40.420 --> 00:19:41.530
I'd like to take the test!

00:19:41.530 --> 00:19:45.140
If your points increase, his
chances will be less than zero.

00:19:50.890 --> 00:19:52.890
Please grade this!

00:20:12.970 --> 00:20:14.370
Yoshii...

00:20:14.370 --> 00:20:15.800
Mizuki Himeji.

00:20:18.480 --> 00:20:19.430
0 points.

00:20:29.930 --> 00:20:31.190
You did good, kid.

00:20:40.980 --> 00:20:43.530
The system is beginning to recover.

00:20:43.890 --> 00:20:46.440
Looks like the problem's solved for now.

00:21:01.930 --> 00:21:09.200
I knew it. My first kiss tasted like strawberry milk

00:21:09.200 --> 00:21:15.820
The sun is setting as I push my bike home

00:21:16.450 --> 00:21:20.810
In my dreamy mind, there's a simulation of delusions

00:21:20.810 --> 00:21:21.740
Here

00:21:21.740 --> 00:21:22.620
Where?

00:21:22.620 --> 00:21:23.110
There
Where?

00:21:23.110 --> 00:21:23.730
There

00:21:23.730 --> 00:21:29.120
I trip 7 times, but fall 8 times

00:21:31.010 --> 00:21:38.210
Everyday is an anniversary

00:21:38.210 --> 00:21:44.230
Let's connect them together to the sky

00:21:45.540 --> 00:21:52.770
Don't you feel that one day you'll become something big?

00:21:52.770 --> 00:21:59.000
Surely, tomorrow will be sunny...

00:22:00.090 --> 00:22:04.390
with a chance of smiles.

00:22:18.340 --> 00:22:19.510
Yoshii!

00:22:19.510 --> 00:22:20.800
Are you okay?

00:22:20.800 --> 00:22:21.530
Yeah.

00:22:21.530 --> 00:22:23.670
That was nothing.

00:22:24.460 --> 00:22:28.460
Those who were KIA must receive supplementary lessons!

00:22:29.590 --> 00:22:31.190
Well...

00:22:31.190 --> 00:22:32.680
I'll see you later.

00:22:33.860 --> 00:22:34.650
Yeah...

00:22:36.510 --> 00:22:37.950
Himeji...

00:22:40.350 --> 00:22:42.390
What are you looking so blue for?

00:22:44.440 --> 00:22:45.420
Oww!

00:22:45.420 --> 00:22:46.760
What the hell was that for?

00:22:47.300 --> 00:22:48.740
My points!

00:22:48.740 --> 00:22:51.760
Don't whine about a couple of points.

00:22:51.760 --> 00:22:53.510
Go take your supplementary lessons.

00:22:56.080 --> 00:22:57.240
Yoshii.

00:23:03.680 --> 00:23:04.310
Yeah.

00:23:07.020 --> 00:23:13.130
It was a pretty big gamble letting the class F kids handle this,

00:23:13.130 --> 00:23:15.130
but I'm glad it worked out in the end.

00:23:15.130 --> 00:23:18.140
I didn't see it as a gamble.

00:23:18.840 --> 00:23:21.810
You'll understand one day.

00:23:21.810 --> 00:23:24.560
How to deal with idiots, that is.

00:23:30.990 --> 00:23:34.640
Miss, me too...

00:23:35.900 --> 00:23:36.920
Question 9:

00:23:36.920 --> 00:23:40.540
We use the unit "cup" to measure the bust size of women.

00:23:40.540 --> 00:23:43.170
Describe the size of a basic A cup.

00:23:43.170 --> 00:23:43.840
Minami Shimada.

00:23:43.840 --> 00:23:45.460
No comment.

00:23:45.460 --> 00:23:48.170
Next episode: Kiss and Bust and Ponytail.

00:23:48.170 --> 00:23:49.770
This will be on your test.
